{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-deu-33-1","title":"Deuteronomy 33:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The majesty of God. 6 The blessings of the twelve tribes. 26 The excellency of Israel.</p>\n<p>the blessing. Ge 27:4,27-29; 49:1,28; Lu 24:50,51; Joh 14:27; 16:33 the man. Jos 14:6; Jud 13:6; 1Sa 2:27; 9:6,7; 1Ki 13:1,6; Ps 90:1; *title 1Ti 6:11; 2Ti 3:17; 2Pe 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-2","title":"Deuteronomy 33:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>came from Sinai. Ex 19:18-20; Jud 5:4,5; Hab 3:3 ten thousands. Ps 68:7,17; Da 7:9; Ac 7:53; Ga 3:19; 2Th 1:7; Heb 2:2; Jude 1:14 Re 5:11 a fiery law. Heb. a fire of law. 5:22; 2Co 3:7,9; Ga 3:10; Heb 12:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-3","title":"Deuteronomy 33:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>he loved. 7:7,8; Ex 19:5,6; Ps 47:4; 147:19,20; Jer 31:3; Ho 11:1; Mal 1:2 Ro 9:11-13; Eph 2:4,5; 1Jo 4:19 all his saints. 7:6; 1Sa 2:9; Ps 31:15; 50:5; Jer 32:40; Joh 10:28,29; 17:11-15 Ro 8:35-39; Col 3:3,4; 1Pe 1:5 they sat. Lu 2:46; 8:35; 10:39; Ac 22:3 shall receive. Pr 2:1; 1Th 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-4","title":"Deuteronomy 33:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Moses. Joh 1:17; 7:19 the inheritance. 9:26-29; Ps 119:72,111</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-5","title":"Deuteronomy 33:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>king. Ge 36:31; Ex 18:16,19; Nu 16:13-15; Jud 8:22; 9:2; 17:6 Jeshurun. 32:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-6","title":"Deuteronomy 33:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Ge 49:3,4,8; Nu 32:31,32; Jos 22:1-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-7","title":"Deuteronomy 33:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>and bring. Ge 49:8-12; Jud 1:1-7; Ps 78:68,70; Mic 5:2; Mal 3:1; Heb 7:14 let his hands. 2Sa 3:1; 5:1,19,24; 1Ch 12:22; 2Ch 17:12-19; Isa 9:17; Re 19:13-16 and be thou. 2Sa 7:9-12; Ps 11:1-7; 20:2; 21:1,8; 110:1,2; 146:5; Lu 19:27 1Co 15:25; Re 20:10-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-8","title":"Deuteronomy 33:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Let thy. Ex 28:30,36; Le 8:8; Nu 27:21; 1Sa 28:6; Ezr 2:63; Ne 7:65 with thy. Le 21:7; Nu 16:5; 2Ch 23:6; Ezr 8:28; Ps 16:10; 106:16; Heb 7:26 Re 3:7 prove at. 8:2,3,16; Ex 17:7; Nu 20:13; Ps 81:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-9","title":"Deuteronomy 33:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Who said. Ex 32:25-29; Le 10:6; 21:11; Mt 10:37; 12:48; 22:16; Lu 14:26 2Co 5:16; Ga 1:10; 1Th 2:4; 1Ti 5:21 I have not. Ge 29:32; 1Ch 17:17; Job 37:24 for they. Jer 18:18; Mal 2:5-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-10","title":"Deuteronomy 33:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>They shall teach. or, Let them teach, etc. 17:9-11; 24:8; Le 10:11; 2Ch 17:8-10; 30:22; Ne 8:1-9,13-15,18 Eze 44:23,24; Ho 4:6; Mal 2:6-8; Mt 23:2,3; Joh 21:15,16 they shall put incense. or, let them put incense. Ex 30:7,8; Nu 16:40,46; 1Sa 2:28; 2Ch 26:18; Lu 1:9,10; Heb 7:25 Heb 9:24; Re 8:3-5 before thee. Heb. at thy nose. whole. Le 1:9,13,17; 9:12,13; Ps 51:19; Eze 43:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-11","title":"Deuteronomy 33:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>his substance. 18:1-5; Nu 18:8-20; 35:2-8 accept. 2Sa 24:23; Ps 20:3; Eze 20:40,41; 43:27; Mal 1:8-10 smite. Isa 29:21; Jer 15:10; Am 5:10; Mt 10:14,15; Lu 10:10-12,16 1Th 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-12","title":"Deuteronomy 33:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>The beloved. 27-29; Jos 18:11-28; Jud 1:21; 1Ki 12:21; 2Ch 11:1; 15:2 2Ch 17:17-19; Ps 132:14; Isa 37:22,35 cover him. Ps 91:4; Isa 51:16; Mt 23:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-13","title":"Deuteronomy 33:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Joseph. Ge 48:5,9,15-20; 49:22-26 the dew. 32:2; Ge 27:28,29; Job 29:19; Ps 110:3; Pr 3:20; 19:12; Isa 18:4 Ho 14:5; Mic 5:7; Zec 8:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-14","title":"Deuteronomy 33:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the precious. 28:8; Le 26:4; 2Sa 23:4; Ps 65:9-13; 74:16; 84:11; Mal 4:2; Mt 5:45 Ac 14:17; 1Ti 6:17 put forth. Heb. thrust forth. moon. Heb. moons. Ps 8:3; 104:19; Re 22:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-15","title":"Deuteronomy 33:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Ge 49:26; Hab 3:6; Jas 5:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-16","title":"Deuteronomy 33:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>the earth. Ps 24:1; 50:12; 89:11; Jer 8:16; *marg: 1Co 10:26,28 the good. Ex 3:2-4; Mr 12:26; Lu 2:14; Ac 7:30-33,35; 2Co 12:7-10 and upon the top. Ge 37:28,36; 39:2,3; 43:32; 45:9-11; 49:26 separated. Heb 7:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-17","title":"Deuteronomy 33:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the firstling. 1Ch 5:1 his horns. Nu 23:22; 24:8; Job 39:9,10; Ps 22:21; 29:6; 92:10; Isa 34:7 unicorns. Heb. an unicorn. he shall push. 1Ki 22:11; 2Ch 18:10; Ps 44:5 the ten thousands. Ge 48:19; Nu 26:34,37; Ho 5:3; 6:4; 7:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-18","title":"Deuteronomy 33:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Ge 49:13-15; Jos 19:11; Jud 5:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-19","title":"Deuteronomy 33:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>call the people. Isa 2:3; Jer 50:4,5; Mic 4:2 they shall. Ps 4:5; 50:13-15; 51:16,17; 107:22; Heb 13:15,16; 1Pe 2:5 suck of. 32:13; Isa 60:5,16; 66:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-20","title":"Deuteronomy 33:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Blessed. Ge 9:26,27; Jos 13:8,10,24-28; 1Ch 4:10; 12:8,37,38; Ps 18:19,36 he dwelleth. 1Ch 5:18-21; 12:8-14 teareth. Mic 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-21","title":"Deuteronomy 33:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>the first part. Nu 32:1-6,16,17-42 a portion. Nu 32:33; Jos 1:14; 22:4 seated. Heb. cieled. he came. Nu 32:16,21; Jos 4:12,13; Jud 5:2,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-22","title":"Deuteronomy 33:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>Ge 49:16,17; Jos 19:47; Jud 13:2,24,25; 14:6,19; 15:8,15; 16:30 Jud 18:27; 1Ch 12:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-23","title":"Deuteronomy 33:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>O. Ge 49:21; Ps 36:8; 90:14; Isa 9:1,2; Jer 31:14; Mt 4:13,16; 11:28 possess. Jos 19:32-39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-24","title":"Deuteronomy 33:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Asher be blessed. Ge 49:20; Ps 115:15; 128:3,6 let him be. Pr 3:3,4; Ex 12:10; Ac 7:10; Ro 14:18; 15:31 let him dip. Job 29:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-25","title":"Deuteronomy 33:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Thy shoes, etc. or, Under thy shoes shall be iron. 8:9; Lu 15:22; Eph 6:15 and as thy. 2Ch 16:9; Ps 138:3; Isa 40:29; 41:10; 1Co 10:13; 2Co 12:9,10 Eph 6:10; Php 4:13; Col 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-26","title":"Deuteronomy 33:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>none. Ex 15:11; Ps 86:8; Isa 40:18,25; 43:11-13; 66:8; Jer 10:6 Jeshurun. 32:15 rideth. Ps 18:10; 68:4,33,34; 104:3; Isa 19:1; Hab 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-27","title":"Deuteronomy 33:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>eternal. 1Sa 15:29; Ps 90:1,2; 102:24; Isa 9:6; 25:4; 57:15; Jer 10:10 Mic 5:2; 1Ti 1:17; Heb 9:14 refuge. Ps 18:2; 27:5; 36:7; 46:1,7,11; 48:3; 91:1,2,9,15; Pr 18:10 Isa 32:2; Lu 13:34; Php 3:9 underneath. Ge 49:24; Pr 10:25; So 2:6; Isa 26:4; 1Pe 1:5; Jude 1:24 thrust. 9:3-5; Joh 10:28,29; Ro 8:2; 16:20; Re 20:2,3,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-28","title":"Deuteronomy 33:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>Israel. Ex 33:16; Nu 23:9; Jer 23:6; 33:16; Eze 34:25; Re 21:27; 22:14,15 the fountain. 8:7,8; Ps 68:26; Pr 5:15-18; Isa 48:1 his. 13; 11:11; 32:2; Ge 27:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-deu-33-29","title":"Deuteronomy 33:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"DEU","chapterStart":33,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":33,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>Happy. 4:7,8; Nu 23:20-24; 24:5; 2Sa 7:23; Ps 33:12; 144:15 saved. Isa 12:2; 45:17; 1Ti 4:10 the shield. Ge 15:1; Ps 84:11; 115:9-11 the sword. Jud 7:20; Ps 7:12; 45:3; Isa 27:1; 34:5,6; Jer 12:12; 47:6; Re 1:16 Re 19:21 found liars. or, subdued. 2Sa 22:45; Ps 18:44; 66:3; 81:15; *margins thou shalt. 32:13; Jos 10:24,25; Hab 3:19</p>"}]}